      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuruka kwa Jesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Sabato yameria kusia, Maria Magdaleni, Maria mae Jakobo, na Salome, wikaghua marumba wighende kumshinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata nakesho kio, Ituku ja Njumwa, wikafuma na kughenda; wikabusa kaburinyi iruwa jikibuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo iji werekoghe wikighenda, wikakotiana weni na weni, wikighamba, “Keni, nani uchaadibingilishira igho jiko mnyangonyi ghwa kaburi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wiendazighana, wikajiwona jija igho jameria kubingilishwa. (Najo jerekoghe ibaa na ndighi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikangia kaburinyi, wikawona mdawana umu uko kidombo chia ya mkonu ghwa kiwomi, urwae nguwo ya chokwa; wikashinika na ndighi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela uo mdawana ukawizera, “Msakeshinika. Namanya mwaawuyamlola Jesu wa Nazareti uo oresulubishiroghe. Waruka, ndeuko aha anduangi. Zighanenyi andu weremmbikieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ghendenyi muwighorie wanughi wake na Petro angu wamkiria noko cha Galilaya. Ahoeni mchammbona sa iji koni oremghorieghe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 26.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 14.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikafuma, wikakimbia kufuma kaburinyi, angu werengiriloghe ni wowa na kushinika. Hata ndeweremghorieghe mndungi ilagho jingi anduangi, angu wereobueghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kumfutukia Maria Magdaleni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu umeria kuruka kokio Ituku ja Njumwa, oremfutukieghe imbiri Maria Magdaleni, uo oremmbingieghe pepo mfungade. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao moni ukaghenda na kuwighoria awo werekwanyeghe nao, angu werekoghe wikisirimika ngolonyi na kulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela awo, iji wasikira angu oko moyo, na wei wamfutukia Maria Magdaleni, wikalegha kurumiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kuwifutukia wanughi wawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyuma sena, Jesu ukawifutukia wawi wawo uko na fwana zima, iji werekoghe wikighenda cha mzinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo weni wikaghenda na kuwighoria awo weresigharikieghe, ela na awo ndewerewirumirieghe anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kuwifutukia waja wanughi ikumi na umweri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutua, Jesu ukawifutukia waja ikumi na umweri wiko kidombo vindonyi, ukawirasha kwa kulegha kurumiria kwawo na kwa kukua kwa ngolo rawo, angu wiserewirumirieghe waja weremmbonieghe nyuma ya kuruka kwake anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawizera, “Ghendenyi wurumwengunyi kose, chilenyi Ilagho Jiboie kwa wadamu wose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 1.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo urumiriagha na kubaputizwa, achaakia; ela uo userumiriagha anduangi uchatanywa utote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na alama iri richawinugha awa wirumiriagha: kwa irina japo wichawinga pepo, na wichaghora na chumi mbishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wichawada choka, na hata ngera wanywa kindo chingi chebwagha, ndewichaawona ilagho jingi anduangi. Wichawiwikiria wakongo mikonu, nawo wichaboa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu kujoka cha mlungunyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Bwana Jesu, nyuma ya kughora nawo ukadwalwa noko aighu mlungunyi, ukasea kidombo chia ya mkonu ghwa kiwomi ghwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.9+ACT.1.10+ACT.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 1.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanughi wikafuma, wikachila andu kose, Bwana moni ukibonya kazi andwamweri nawo; ukijimangisha jija ilagho kwa weke mwakilimbiti werebonyeroghe. Amen.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
